  - H2: 22px / 600 / 1.3
  - H3: 17px / 600 / 1.35
  - Body Large: 16px / 400 / 1.55
  - Body: 14px / 400 / 1.5
  - Body Small: 12px / 500 / 1.4
  - Code: 13px / 400 / 1.65 mono
  - Caption: 11px / 600 / 1.3

